{"Name": "MBON01", "Id": "FBbt_00100234", "SuperTypes": ["Entity", "Class", "Neuron", "Adult", "Anatomy", "Cell", "Glutamatergic", "Nervous_system", "lineage_SMPad3_DAMd1", "primary_neuron"], "Meta": {"Name": "[mushroom body output neuron 1](FBbt_00100234)", "Symbol": "[MBON01](FBbt_00100234)", "Description": "A bilateral, glutamatergic neuron whose cell body is located on the superior neuropils, anterior to the pars intercerebralis of the adult brain ([Tanaka et al., 2008](FBrf0205263); [Aso et al., 2014](FBrf0227179)). The cell body fiber travels ventrally towards the medial lobe, arborizing in the anterior layer of beta' lobe slice 2 and the most medial segment of the gamma lobe (slice 5) ([Tanaka et al., 2008](FBrf0205263)). The main fiber then enters the opposite gamma lobe, arborizes in the beta' lobe slice 2 and gamma lobe slice 5. The major axon projects ipsilaterally to the superior medial protocerebrum (SMP), whereas a very thin axon projects to the crepine and SMP in the other hemisphere. There is one neuron of this type per hemisphere ([Aso et al., 2014](FBrf0227179); [Li et al., 2020](FBrf0248215)). It develops from the larval MBON-k1 ([Truman et al., 2023](FBrf0255928)). These neurons have synaptic connections with protocerebral anterior medial (PAM) cluster neurons in the SMP and in the tip of the mushroom body horizontal lobe ([Owald et al., 2015](FBrf0228212)). It is involved in the retrieval of long term memory associated with water reward ([Shyu et al., 2017](FBrf0235522)) as well as medium and long term aversive memory ([Bouzaiane et al., 2015](FBrf0228475)).\n([Shyu et al., 2017](FBrf0235522), [Tanaka et al., 2008](FBrf0205263), [Owald et al., 2015](FBrf0228212), [Aso et al., 2014](FBrf0227179), [Truman et al., 2023](FBrf0255928), [Li et al., 2020](FBrf0248215), [Bouzaiane et al., 2015](FBrf0228475))", "Comment": "Synapsing with PAM neurons determined by GRASP ([Owald et al., 2015](FBrf0228212)).", "Types": "[adult SMPad3 lineage neuron](FBbt_00050174); [adult glutamatergic neuron](FBbt_00058208); [adult typical mushroom body output neuron](FBbt_00049843); [primary interneuron](FBbt_00052517); [supraesophageal ganglion neuron](FBbt_00001366)", "Relationships": "[bearer of](RO_0000053): [bilateral](PATO_0000618); [capable_of_part_of](RO_0002216): [long-term memory](GO_0007616), [medium-term memory](GO_0072375); [develops from](RO_0002202): [larval mushroom body output neuron k1](FBbt_00047985); [has soma location](RO_0002100): [adult superior brain cell body rind](FBbt_00100308); [receives synaptic input from neuron](RO_0013008): [adult dopaminergic PAM neuron](FBbt_00100214); [receives synaptic input in region](RO_0013002): [mushroom body anterior layer of beta' lobe slice 2](FBbt_00047093), [mushroom body gamma lobe slice 5](FBbt_00100277); [sends synaptic output to cell](RO_0013009): [adult dopaminergic PAM neuron](FBbt_00100214); [sends synaptic output to region](RO_0013003): [adult crepine](FBbt_00045037), [superior medial protocerebrum](FBbt_00007055)"}, "Tags": ["Adult", "Glutamatergic", "lineage_SMPad3_DAMd1", "primary_neuron"], "Queries": [{"query": "ListAllAvailableImages", "label": "List all available images of MBON01", "function": "get_instances", "takes": {"short_form": {"$and": ["Class", "Anatomy"]}, "default": {"short_form": "FBbt_00100234"}}, "preview": 5, "preview_columns": ["id", "label", "tags", "thumbnail"], "preview_results": {"status": "pending", "message": "This preview has not been computed yet, so count is -1 (not counted) rather than 0 (no matches). The full results are being computed in the background; request this term again shortly, or run the query directly to get the results now.", "headers": ["id", "label", "tags", "thumbnail"], "rows": []}, "output_format": "table", "count": -1}, {"query": "SplitsTargeting", "label": "Splits specifically targeting MBON01", "function": "get_splits_targeting", "takes": {"short_form": {"$and": ["Class", "Neuron"]}, "default": {"short_form": "FB